RATIONALE:
The committee converges cleanly. The two GREEN votes (evaluation_prosecutor, theory_skeptic) endorse the NEGATIVE as methodologically sound and theoretically predicted — they are GREEN *on the kill*, not on the claim. The three RED votes (novelty_killer, systems_reviewer, product_realist) independently confirm the claim is dead on novelty, systems contribution, and product viability respectively. No reviewer dissents from the kill; disagreement is only on which dimension is primary.

Aggregating the evidence chain: (1) Part (A) holds — APC structurally misses 30–38% of schema tokens, the opportunity is real and large. (2) Part (B) fails — RoPE position-dependence collapses the token-level ceiling (0.42–0.44) to position-aware reuse of 0.11–0.19 (26–42% survival); the diag_where.csv breakdown is dispositive: pre-first-value schema = 100% stable but = the prefix APC already captures; post-first-value schema (85% of all schema) = 14.9% reusable, and the fixed-length control (RoPE tax = 0.000, c/b = 1.0) proves the residual is coincidental length alignment, not position stability. (3) The honest structural win over APC (c−a = 0.051–0.063) is below the pre-registered 10% threshold across all 6 (N, cx) cells. (4) The prior-art pincer is verified in ≥2 independent sources per the anti-hallucination rule: Prompt Cache (arXiv:2311.04934) + CacheBlend (arXiv:2405.16444) + EPIC (arXiv:2410.15332), plus in-repo corroboration from EXP-0009/HANDOFF.

The claim was well-designed — it deliberately avoided the Jensen-floor tuning trap (EXP-0006/0011/0027) by targeting a structural/discrete win, and it honestly confronted the RoPE trap rather than assuming it away. The negative is clean and informative. But the kill is definitive: the one would-be-novel pillar ("position-stable without re-anchoring") is empirically dead, and the mechanism space is saturated by published work. An L1 GPU re-run would confirm the wall at higher fidelity but cannot manufacture novelty the prior-art pincer has already closed. Recommend kill-converge with DEAD-0002 (EXP-0009, same RoPE wall) under DEAD-0003; no L1 warranted.

